# Both container images are built with the repository root as their context,
# because each needs a workspace module alongside its own app directory:
# `apps/computer-host` needs `computer/host-protocol` and `computer/fly`, and
# `apps/applet-build` needs `applets/sdk` and the build contract. Both images
# also use the shared core crypto primitives. Everything else stays out of the
# context.
*
!apps/computer-host
!apps/applet-build
!computer/package.json
!computer/host-protocol
!computer/fly/runtime.ts
!computer/fly/shell.ts
!applets/package.json
!applets/build-contract.ts
!applets/sdk
!core/package.json
!core/crypto.ts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.wrangler
**/.dev.vars
